  "title": "Pecan Sweet Potato Bread",
  "description": "Stir your leftover sweet potatoes from the holidays into a nicely spiced, quick bread batter dotted with pecans for a sweet treat for breakfast or snacks.",
  "authors": [
    "Chef Jen"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:52:19-04:00",
